      "source": "Create a <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> for reuse in the <a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a> and the <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcConverter</code></a>.\nOverride this method to register a bean of type <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> if your use case requires a more\nspecialized <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>.",
